    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "info@youragency.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.firstName }}, 3 Common {{ $json.insuranceType }} Mistakes to Avoid",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; }\n    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }\n    .content { padding: 40px 30px; }\n    .mistake { background: #fff3cd; padding: 20px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .mistake-number { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffc107; }\n    .solution { background: #d4edda; padding: 15px; margin: 10px 0; border-radius: 5px; }\n    .cta-button { background: #28a745; color: white; padding: 15px 40px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin: 20px 0; font-weight: bold; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <h2>Hi {{ $json.firstName }},</h2>\n      \n      <p>Over my 15 years helping {{ $json.state }} residents with insurance, I've seen these 3 costly mistakes over and over...</p>\n      \n      <div class=\"mistake\">\n        <div class=\"mistake-number\">Mistake #1</div>\n        <strong>Choosing the cheapest policy without reading the fine print</strong>\n        <p>Many people get surprised by what's NOT covered when they need it most.</p>\n        <div class=\"solution\">✅ <strong>Better approach:</strong> We review all coverage details and find the best VALUE (not just lowest price).</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"mistake\">\n        <div class=\"mistake-number\">Mistake #2</div>\n        <strong>{{ $json.insuranceType.toLowerCase().includes('life') ? 'Waiting too long to get coverage' : 'Staying with the same carrier year after year' }}</strong>\n        <p>{{ $json.insuranceType.toLowerCase().includes('life') ? 'Rates go up as you age and health changes. The best time to get coverage is NOW.' : 'Carriers often raise rates on existing customers while offering better deals to new ones.' }}</p>\n        <div class=\"solution\">✅ <strong>Better approach:</strong> {{ $json.insuranceType.toLowerCase().includes('life') ? 'Lock in your rate while you\\'re younger and healthier.' : 'Review your coverage annually to ensure you\\'re getting the best rate.' }}</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"mistake\">\n        <div class=\"mistake-number\">Mistake #3</div>\n        <strong>{{ $json.insuranceType.toLowerCase().includes('life') ? 'Not getting enough coverage' : 'Paying for coverage you don\\'t need' }}</strong>\n        <p>{{ $json.insuranceType.toLowerCase().includes('life') ? 'Most people underestimate how much coverage their family would need.' : 'Many policies include add-ons you\\'ll never use.' }}</p>\n        <div class=\"solution\">✅ <strong>Better approach:</strong> We calculate exactly what you need - no more, no less.</div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <p><strong>Want to make sure you're not making these mistakes?</strong></p>\n      <p>Let's do a quick 10-minute review. I'll show you:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Your best coverage options</li>\n        <li>Where you might be overpaying</li>\n        <li>How to maximize your coverage while minimizing cost</li>\n      </ul>\n      \n      <a href=\"https://calendly.com/youragency/consultation\" class=\"cta-button\">Schedule Free Review →</a>\n      \n      <p>Or reply to this email with \"YES\" and I'll call you.</p>\n      \n      <p>Here to help,<br>\n      <strong>Your Insurance Team</strong></p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {}
