        "fromEmail": "info@youragency.com",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "={{ $json.firstName }}, Real Stories from {{ $json.state }} Residents Like You",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }\n    .testimonial { background: #f8f9fa; padding: 25px; border-left: 4px solid #667eea; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }\n    .author { font-weight: bold; color: #667eea; margin-top: 10px; }\n    .stars { color: #ffc107; font-size: 20px; }\n    .cta-button { background: #667eea; color: white; padding: 15px 40px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin: 20px 0; font-weight: bold; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 30px;\">\n    <h2>Hi {{ $json.firstName }},</h2>\n    \n    <p>I wanted to share what some of your neighbors in {{ $json.state }} have said after working with us...</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"testimonial\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n      <p>\"I was paying $285/month for my {{ $json.insuranceType.toLowerCase().includes('life') ? 'term life' : 'health' }} insurance. After working with [Agency Name], I'm now paying $167/month for BETTER coverage. Saved over $1,400 this year!\"</p>\n      <div class=\"author\">- Sarah M., {{ $json.state }}</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"testimonial\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n      <p>\"I put off getting {{ $json.insuranceType }} for years because I thought it would be complicated and expensive. [Agent Name] made it so easy - the whole process took 15 minutes and I'm paying way less than I expected.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"author\">- Mike T., {{ $json.state }}</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"testimonial\">\n      <div class=\"stars\">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n      <p>\"What I appreciated most was that [Agent Name] didn't try to upsell me. They helped me find exactly what I needed at the best price. No pressure, just honest advice.\"</p>\n      <div class=\"author\">- Jennifer L., {{ $json.state }}</div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <p><strong>Ready to see how much you could save?</strong></p>\n    \n    <a href=\"https://calendly.com/youragency/consultation\" class=\"cta-button\">Get Your Free Quote →</a>\n    \n    <p>Still have questions? Just reply to this email or call: <strong>(123) 456-7890</strong></p>\n    \n    <p>Talk soon!</p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {}
