        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: #333; }\n    .content { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 30px; }\n    .highlight { background: #fff3cd; padding: 20px; border-left: 4px solid #ffc107; margin: 20px 0; }\n    .cta-button { background: #28a745; color: white; padding: 15px 40px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; display: inline-block; margin: 20px 0; font-weight: bold; }\n    .remove-link { color: #dc3545; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <h2>Hi {{ $json.firstName }},</h2>\n    \n    <p>I haven't heard back from you about your {{ $json.insuranceType }} coverage, so I wanted to reach out one last time.</p>\n    \n    <div class=\"highlight\">\n      <strong>I'm about to close your file, but wanted to check first:</strong><br><br>\n      \n      Are you still interested in:<br>\n      ✓ Comparing rates from 20+ insurance carriers?<br>\n      ✓ Potentially saving hundreds per year on coverage?<br>\n      ✓ Getting personalized recommendations for your situation?\n    </div>\n    \n    <p><strong>If YES:</strong> Click below and I'll personally help you find the best coverage at the best price.</p>\n    \n    <a href=\"https://calendly.com/youragency/consultation\" class=\"cta-button\">Yes, I Still Need Help →</a>\n    \n    <p><strong>If NO:</strong> No worries at all! <a href=\"{{ $json.unsubscribeUrl }}\" class=\"remove-link\">Click here to remove yourself from my follow-up list</a>.</p>\n    \n    <p>Either way, I appreciate you considering us!</p>\n    \n    <p>Best wishes,<br>\n    <strong>[Your Name]</strong><br>\n    [Your Agency]<br>\n    (123) 456-7890</p>\n    \n    <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #666; margin-top: 30px;\"><em>P.S. - If your situation has changed and you need coverage now, call me directly at (123) 456-7890. I'm here to help!</em></p>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
        "options": {}
